The way I look at it, this is the best DoW game out of all of them, and I will attempt to justify that;
And of course, a game is not without its bads, or what I would consider on the table before purchase;
Despite this all, I still find time to kill with this game and I personally would recommend this to any RTS or Warhammer lover out there due to its unqueness and just over all fun to be had epecially with other players online. You just can't beat $12.99 USD, unless of course it goes on sale, and that's just highway robbery on the buyers part, seriously all of that content for less that $12.99 USD, like holy♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥matee'.

