It's a good Half-Life 2 mod, even if it's short, it's worth playing it through. Lore-wise this might be a little confusing but maps are really well-made, I like the open-ness of the levels despite of the overall length of this mod. Weapons can be obtained very quickly, though this is somewhat made due to length of mod. Wish there could be more content like this but I'm happy playing through what was given by developers.
